            <div xml:id="d963">

                <pb facs="0741" n="625" xml:id="pg625"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/13833.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Irapttato</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 19, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General Gutiérrez conferred with General Villa yesterday afternoon and it was
                    decided that General Villa remain at the head of Convention troops. Progress
                    rapid southward.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carothers</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
